	(text "Field domain: +24V_IN (adapter) -> F1 -> +24V_F -> TSR 1-2450 -> +5V_F.  GND_F = adapter 0 V.\nJ_C pins 26/27 (+24V_BANK) are fed from F2 (2 A) through solder jumper JP1, normally open.\nNo protective earth connection on this board: connect the adapter PE to the enclosure."
